HzLab is an independent, clean-room project. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by the original PitchLab project or its author.

No source code, binary libraries, artwork, icons, screenshots, layouts or
other assets from PitchLab are included in this repository. The app name,
logo, UI text, source code, visualisers and audio pipeline were created for
this project.

The built-in tuning presets (instrument names and note lists) and temperament
presets (historical cent offsets) are factual musical data. They are included
so musicians can use common tunings and historical temperaments.

The app records audio only while it is open and only to analyse pitch locally.
It contains no advertising, analytics, tracking or network permission.
